{"seq":4,"slug":"financial-independence","title":"财务自由规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/personal-finance/retirement-planning/financial-independence","wordCount":1650,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"财务自由规划\">财务自由规划</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>财务自由（Financial Independence）是指被动收入足以覆盖生活支出的状态——你不再需要为了支付账单而工作。对程序员来说，财务自由不意味着退休不工作，而是拥有<strong>选择权</strong>：你可以选择继续编程、转行做独立开发者、做开源项目、或者旅行写作——因为你的生活费用已经被投资收益覆盖。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[被动收入 vs 生活支出] --&gt; B{被动收入 ≥ 生活支出?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[财务自由]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D[继续积累]&#10;    C --&gt; E[选择工作]&#10;    C --&gt; F[选择休息]&#10;    C --&gt; G[选择探索]&#10;    D --&gt; H[增加收入]&#10;    D --&gt; I[降低支出]&#10;    D --&gt; J[提高投资收益]&#10;    H --&gt; D&#10;    I --&gt; D&#10;    J --&gt; D\">flowchart TD\n    A[被动收入 vs 生活支出] --&gt; B{被动收入 ≥ 生活支出?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[财务自由]\n    B --&gt;|否| D[继续积累]\n    C --&gt; E[选择工作]\n    C --&gt; F[选择休息]\n    C --&gt; G[选择探索]\n    D --&gt; H[增加收入]\n    D --&gt; I[降低支出]\n    D --&gt; J[提高投资收益]\n    H --&gt; D\n    I --&gt; D\n    J --&gt; D</pre><p>财务自由的核心数字指标：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>计算公式</th>\n<th>目标值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>FIRE 数字</td>\n<td>实现财务自由需要的资产总额</td>\n<td>年支出 × 25</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4% 法则</td>\n<td>每年可安全提取的比例</td>\n<td>投资组合 × 4%</td>\n<td>覆盖年支出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>被动收入比</td>\n<td>被动收入 / 总支出</td>\n<td>被动收入 ÷ 月支出</td>\n<td>≥100%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>储蓄率</td>\n<td>储蓄 / 税后收入</td>\n<td>月储蓄 ÷ 税后月收入</td>\n<td>≥50%(加速FIRE)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FI 进度</td>\n<td>当前资产 / FIRE 数字</td>\n<td>净资产 ÷ (年支出×25)</td>\n<td>100% = 达成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>4% 法则</strong>是 FIRE 运动的核心理论基础。基于美国 Trinity Study 的研究结论：如果你的投资组合以 60/40 股债比配置，每年提取 4%（首年按总额的 4%，之后按通胀调整），在 95% 的历史 30 年期中，资产不会耗尽。这意味着你需要积累年支出 25 倍的资产。</p>\n<h2 id=\"fire-数字计算\">FIRE 数字计算</h2><p>计算你的 FIRE 数字是制定财务自由计划的第一步。这个数字决定了你的目标和达成时间线。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface FIRECalculation {&#10;  monthlyExpense: number;&#10;  currentNetWorth: number;&#10;  monthlyInvestment: number;&#10;  expectedReturn: number;&#10;  inflationRate: number;&#10;  safeWithdrawalRate: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function calculateFIRE(calc: FIRECalculation): {&#10;  fireNumber: number;&#10;  yearsToFIRE: number;&#10;  monthlyPassiveIncome: number;&#10;  currentProgress: number;&#10;  milestones: { percentage: number; amount: number; years: number }[];&#10;} {&#10;  const annualExpense = calc.monthlyExpense * 12;&#10;  const fireNumber = annualExpense / calc.safeWithdrawalRate;&#10;  const realReturn = calc.expectedReturn - calc.inflationRate;&#10;  const monthlyReturn = realReturn / 12;&#10;&#10;  let balance = calc.currentNetWorth;&#10;  let months = 0;&#10;  while (balance &lt; fireNumber &amp;&amp; months &lt; 600) {&#10;    balance = balance * (1 + monthlyReturn) + calc.monthlyInvestment;&#10;    months++;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const yearsToFIRE = months / 12;&#10;  const currentProgress = calc.currentNetWorth / fireNumber;&#10;&#10;  const milestones = [25, 50, 75, 100].map((pct) =&gt; {&#10;    const targetAmount = (fireNumber * pct) / 100;&#10;    let bal = calc.currentNetWorth;&#10;    let m = 0;&#10;    while (bal &lt; targetAmount &amp;&amp; m &lt; 600) {&#10;      bal = bal * (1 + monthlyReturn) + calc.monthlyInvestment;&#10;      m++;&#10;    }&#10;    return { percentage: pct, amount: Math.round(targetAmount), years: Math.round((m / 12) * 10) / 10 };&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  return {&#10;    fireNumber: Math.round(fireNumber),&#10;    yearsToFIRE: Math.round(yearsToFIRE * 10) / 10,&#10;    monthlyPassiveIncome: Math.round((fireNumber * calc.safeWithdrawalRate) / 12),&#10;    currentProgress: Math.round(currentProgress * 100) / 100,&#10;    milestones,&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FIRECalculation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  monthlyExpense</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  currentNetWorth</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  monthlyInvestment</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  expectedReturn</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  inflationRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  safeWithdrawalRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"li